{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1383235-kithbooks-a-suggestion","id":1383235,"title":"Kithbooks! A suggestion.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-22T15:41:44-07:00","id":1383235,"title":"Kithbooks! A suggestion.","content":"Basically, I think we need new C20 Kithbooks. <br /> <br /> I think each of the Kiths in the main text should be paired with a less known or newer kith that fits with the other Kith thematically. Example: Slaugh and Stregas would make a good pair. <br /> <br /> The Arcadian and Autumn Sidhe should be in the same book, with the option of Autumn Sidhe having plus ones to both Charisma and Appearance instead of plus two to Appearance.<br /> <br /> Note: I don't see the Nobles book (which we need an update) as replacing a book on the Sidhe. Not all nobles are Sidhe and if the game is set before 1968, very few nobles are Sidhe. Similarly, we'll want/need House books for all Fourteen Houses, but every Noble House proudly has non-Sidhe members. So Sidhe kithbooks on the Sidhe as a kith is needed. <br /> <br /> Reactions? Polite but firm critiques? Agreements?<br /> <br /> Please comment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T15:50:32-07:00","id":1383237,"title":"","content":"...I think it's a bit iffy to try to bring in a fanmade STVault product into official materials like that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T16:18:15-07:00","id":1383242,"title":"","content":"I'd rather a New Book of Nobility and Houses than a Sidhe book. This will by its nature cover sidhe but also changes to houses commoner kith nobles etc.<br /> <br /> A book on Kiths, covering greater detail the ones we have, and maybe say a custom &quot;Build this kith&quot; in the book which goes through not only building things but the sort of lore one might look for etc...(it should be dragons btw)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T17:33:47-07:00","id":1383248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1383235-kithbooks-a-suggestion?p=1383237#post1383237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...I think it's a bit iffy to try to bring in a fanmade STVault product into official materials like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>First off, the idea of doing the Stregas was genius. The perfect kith to cover storybook witches. A major Gap in the archetypes filled. <br /> <br /> Second, I was only giving an example of a possible pairing of an established and less known/acknowledged kith. And a pair that fit together thematically.<br /> <br /> Third, it's meant to be the established kith that sells the book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T17:45:28-07:00","id":1383251,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1383235-kithbooks-a-suggestion?p=1383242#post1383242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd rather a New Book of Nobility and Houses than a Sidhe book. This will by its nature cover sidhe but also changes to houses commoner kith nobles etc.<br /> <br /> A book on Kiths, covering greater detail the ones we have, and maybe say a custom &amp;quot;Build this kith&amp;quot; in the book which goes through not only building things but the sort of lore one might look for etc...(it should be dragons btw)</div> </div> </div> </div>Both ideas have value. But as I pointed out, neither all nobles are Sidhe, nor are all members of Noble houses. Sidhe as a kith need exploration away from the concepts of nobility (not exclusive to them) or Noble houses (again not exclusive to the Sidhe).<br /> <br /> Rifting off your book on Kiths, I think a book on broadly changing basic premises of the setting in terms of mechanics of the setting would be good. Storytelling is vital, but game mechanics have their place. <br /> <br /> Not just changing the Kiths, how about changing the courts. Changing: The Lost had four courts in the main book ( and introduced at least eight more). A lesser but interesting change would be changing the Noble Houses. Let's have alternate Noble Houses with Greek, Persian, or Arab backgrounds. There are many ways changing the mechanics transforms the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T17:50:45-07:00","id":1383252,"title":"","content":"All Sidhe are nobles. Not all Nobles are Sidhe. I don't think there really is much &quot;unique SIdhe culture&quot; outside the houses. Yes you can make a sidhe who has no house and title, but you can also make a Vegan Redcap.. doesn't mean it should have a whole book dedicated to it Or a pooka who turns into an animal they can never use...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T18:38:34-07:00","id":1383265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1383235-kithbooks-a-suggestion#post1383235\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Basically, I think we need new C20 Kithbooks.<br /> <br /> I think each of the Kiths in the main text should be paired with a less known or newer kith that fits with the other Kith thematically. Example: Slaugh and Stregas would make a good pair.<br /> <br /> The Arcadian and Autumn Sidhe should be in the same book, with the option of Autumn Sidhe having plus ones to both Charisma and Appearance instead of plus two to Appearance.<br /> <br /> Note: I don't see the Nobles book (which we need an update) as replacing a book on the Sidhe. Not all nobles are Sidhe and if the game is set before 1968, very few nobles are Sidhe. Similarly, we'll want/need House books for all Fourteen Houses, but every Noble House proudly has non-Sidhe members. So Sidhe kithbooks on the Sidhe as a kith is needed.<br /> <br /> Reactions? Polite but firm critiques? Agreements?<br /> <br /> Please comment.</div> </div> </div> </div>These are good idea! I don't know if they would commit to making multiple changeling books, but I would it up. The two in one Kithbook is a good choice for getting stuff out there. And I know we have a lot of nobles books but it would be nice to also get a Sidhe book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T19:18:00-07:00","id":1383270,"title":"","content":"Another possibility is kith books that cover four to six Kiths. Divy up the less known Kiths from the C20 Players Guide, the Kiths towards the back of the main book, and the better fan creations like the Strega, and have each book &quot;headlines&quot; by two or more of the main Kiths. <br /> <br /> Six books could cover all the Changeling Kiths in the main books. Then the Gallain Kiths like the Nunnehi, the Hsien, the lnanimae, the Menehuni, and others could get their own books. Heck we might get books in the Peris, the Kami, and the Djinni ( or rather the fay equivalents of such).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-22T21:26:58-07:00","id":1383287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1383235-kithbooks-a-suggestion?p=1383248#post1383248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First off, the idea of doing the Stregas was genius. The perfect kith to cover storybook witches. A major Gap in the archetypes filled.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hey, thanks a bunch for the high praise. Filling that archetypical gap was a big part reason behind the book.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3670-spook359","name":"Spook359","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3670_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-23T03:23:27-07:00","id":1383321,"title":"","content":"These will all need to be ST Vault books. Paradox is not authorising any new CtD ( or WtO) books. Thats part of the reason the developers and freelancers are releasing stuff through the Radio Free Arcadia imprint on the Vault.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-24T02:20:24-07:00","id":1383539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1383235-kithbooks-a-suggestion?p=1383321#post1383321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a